# inQbeta post office — who may do what (ADR-Q-010 §4).
# %u is the signed-in inbox id. Nothing else is granted, including $SYS.

# You may read your own inbox, and only your own.
pattern read q/in/%u

# Anyone signed in may post into any inbox (one level: q/in/<inbox-id>).
pattern write q/in/+

# The storage unit's gate (node/gate) rings a federation's news channel when a
# new signed announcement is stored. Only it may (ADR-Q-016 §6).
user gate
topic write q/fed/+/news
